  "content": "# 擴展三叉戟附魔\n\n**此資料包與模組** 將武器附魔擴展至三叉戟，新增火焰附加、擊退、掠奪、穿刺、密度、破甲與風暴爆發等附魔效果。同時允許您在同一把三叉戟上混合不同類型的武器附魔！\n\n**◾範例：**\n\n![擴展三叉戟附魔](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c52f1a0ac7ffd152c4f25ed7701ce3061d8e992.jpeg)\n\n![擴展三叉戟附魔](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f885bc7c037174546d7ccd3144bee3f78e2c90de.jpeg)\n\n## 詳細說明📝\n\n- **擴展三叉戟附魔** 相容於版本 **1.21 至 1.21.11**\n- **擴展三叉戟附魔** 為附魔台🌐新增 **(擴展)** 功能\n- **擴展三叉戟附魔** 可與任何 **附魔類資料包** 相容使用\n- **無需** 解壓縮下載的檔案 🗂️\n\n## 更多專案：\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-armor-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TM5K3dNM/ezgif-com-speed-43.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (43)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/expanded-weapon-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bML9W70B/ezgif-com-speed-44.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (44)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-trident-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VcwSJqRJ/Expanded-Trident-Enchants-Logo.jpg\" alt=\"Expanded Trident Enchants Logo\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-mace-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXv2pS15/Expanded-Mace-Enchants-Logo-2.jpg\" alt=\"Expanded Mace Enchants Logo (2)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-axe-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Fqxsn0qL/ezgif-com-speed-47.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (47)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-bow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWLkm7bC/ezgif-com-speed-48.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (48)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-crossbow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PzT0xXgD/ezgif-com-speed-49.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (49)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-spear-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tTJBJp9c/ezgif-com-resize-1.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com resize (1)\" border=\"0\"></a>",
